# The server image's build context (infra/docker/server.Dockerfile). What is left out is
# either rebuilt inside the image or must never reach it.

# Rebuilt inside the image from the lockfile and the sources.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/.output
**/.wxt

# Secrets and personal data (invariant 10). Only the examples, which hold names.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
packages/db/.dev-users.local.json
infra/kamal/secrets*

# Not needed to build or run the server.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
apps/server/migration-sample
bench-results
